# Demo UI/UX quality checklist

For deeper design guidance, use the `ui-ux-pro-max` skill in `.cursor/skills/`.

## Icons & visual elements
- Use SVG icons — never emojis as UI icons.

## Interaction
- Every clickable control has `cursor-pointer`.
- Hover feedback via color/opacity transitions (150–300ms).
- Visible keyboard focus states.

## Contrast & color
- Body text contrast >= 4.5:1 on dark backgrounds.

## Motion
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` in demo controls.

## Pre-delivery
- [ ] All interactive elements have `cursor-pointer` + focus states
- [ ] Sufficient text contrast
- [ ] Responsive, no horizontal scroll at 375px
